      "id": "claim_67bc0bd4217544de9b7ddb97de66989f",
      "statement": "On macOS, TermindApp is the composition root: it creates one SwiftData container, prepares persistence and Keychain-backed services, constructs sync/outbox/repository dependencies, and retains one AppModel in SwiftUI state; failure to open the local container terminates startup rather than substituting an empty store.",
